hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"27909","Yahya ibn Said narrated to us, from Ibn Jurayj, he said: Abd al-Hamid ibn Jubayr ibn Shaybah informed me, and Ibn Bakr said: Ibn Jurayj narrated to us, and Rawh said: Ibn Jurayj narrated to us, he said: Abd al-Hamid ibn Jubayr ibn Shaybah narrated to us, that Ibn al-Musayyab informed him that Umm Sharik informed him that she sought the counsel of the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, regarding killing geckos, so he ordered her to kill the geckos. Ibn Bakr and Rawh said: And Umm Sharik is one of the women of Banu Amir ibn Luayy."
